# Evil Reawakened: "Return target creature card from your graveyard to the battlefield with two additional +1/+1 counters on it."
# Bot2's Entomb has put Memnite in Bot2's graveyard: it is refused as the target (CR 115.1, "your graveyard"). Bot1's own
# Entomb has put Ornithopter, a 0/2, in its graveyard: Evil Reawakened returns it with exactly two +1/+1 counters (CR 614.1c,
# 122.6), so it is 2/4, and the Entomb in the graveyard, not a creature card, is no target either.

